    <section id="landing-pages">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2>Common buying paths.</h2>
          <p>Most property management teams start with the workflow that is easiest to measure: missed calls, leasing follow-up, maintenance intake, or CRM cleanup.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="landing-links">
          <a class="landing-link" href="/blog/property-management-ai-automation-vs-chatbots/">
            <strong>Property management AI intake</strong>
            <span>Capture leasing, tenant, owner, and vendor context from inbound conversations.</span>
          </a>
          <a class="landing-link" href="/blog/missed-call-text-back-property-management/">
            <strong>Missed-call text-back</strong>
            <span>Respond when a prospect calls after hours or while the team is unavailable.</span>
          </a>
          <a class="landing-link" href="/blog/property-management-maintenance-intake-automation/">
