    <section id="contact">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="cta">
          <h2>Ready to see what your first workflow should be?</h2>
          <p>Send us your current intake process and we’ll identify where automation can save time, speed up response, and increase booked showings.</p>
          <a href="/book-demo/" class="btn btn-primary">Book a 15-minute consultation</a>
